t/issues/105992","id":2845466003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pml2T","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T18:44:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T18:51:58Z","body":"@uno1982 \r\nDoes `KEYCODE_MENU` trigger when `PS button` is pressed? Then it might be better to map it with `button = 5`.\r\n_(still missing in the switch/case block, and `button = 15`)_. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.partitionwizard.com/partitionmagic/ps4-controller-buttons.html\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[JoyButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_@globalscope.html#enum-globalscope-joybutton)\r\n\r\n>**JOY_BUTTON_BACK = 4**\r\nGame controller SDL back button. Corresponds to the Sony Select, Xbox Back, Nintendo - button.\r\n>**JOY_BUTTON_GUIDE = 5**\r\nGame controller SDL guide button. Corresponds to the Sony PS, Xbox Home button.\r\n>**JOY_BUTTON_START = 6**\r\nGame controller SDL start button. Corresponds to the Sony Options, Xbox Menu, Nintendo + button.\r\n> **JOY_BUTTON_MISC1 = 15**\r\nGame controller SDL miscellaneous button. Corresponds to Xbox share button, PS5 microphone button, Nintendo Switch capture button.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845466003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845494888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105992#issuecomment-2845494888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105992","id":2845494888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pms5o","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T18:53:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T19:06:34Z","body":"> @uno1982 Does `KEYCODE_MENU` trigger when `PS button` is pressed? Then it might be better to map it with `button = 5`. _(still missing in the switch/case block, and `button = 15`)_.\r\n> \r\n> https://www.partitionwizard.com/partitionmagic/ps4-controller-buttons.html\r\n> \r\n> [JoyButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_@globalscope.html#enum-globalscope-joybutton)\r\n> \r\n> > **JOY_BUTTON_BACK = 4**\r\n> > Game controller SDL back button. Corresponds to the Sony Select, Xbox Back, Nintendo - button.\r\n> > **JOY_BUTTON_GUIDE = 5**\r\n> > Game controller SDL guide button. Corresponds to the Sony PS, Xbox Home button.\r\n> > **JOY_BUTTON_START = 6**\r\n> > Game controller SDL start button. Corresponds to the Sony Options, Xbox Menu, Nintendo + button.\r\n> > **JOY_BUTTON_MISC1 = 15**\r\n> > Game controller SDL miscellaneous button. Corresponds to Xbox share button, PS5 microphone button, Nintendo Switch capture button.\r\n\r\nNo when you hit the PS button it is almost a system mapping on the android to go \"home\" .... I'm not sure if that button would ever be relevant to the app since the OS actually fires events based on it? \r\n\r\nClarity on behavior: The app moves to the background and the home screen appears and auto focuses your home recent apps list.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845494888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845535286","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105992#issuecomment-2845535286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105992","id":2845535286,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pm2w2","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex27